      "summary_en": "A video of RJD MLA Naresh Prasad Singh from Palamu, Jharkhand, has gone viral, showing him crossing the Dhuriya river while sitting on a man's shoulders. The two lost their balance and fell into the water midway.\n\nThe incident has raised questions over the lack of a bridge, with villagers reportedly demanding one for years. The video also shows another person carrying the MLA's shoe.\n\n#Jharkhand #Palamu #RJD #NareshPrasadSingh",
